{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n \\\"交叉点|汇合|双色分段|corner.*legend|K=5|line segment\\\" /home/lixinyu/snap -g '*.py' -g '*.json' -g '*.md'\"","aggregated_output":"/home/lixinyu/snap/new/rebuild_tags_100.py:77:    \"object:line_segment\":     [\"line segment\", \"bar\", \"segment\", \"直线\", \"线段\", \"横线\", \"竖线\"],\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/annotations/c4d067a0.json:2:  \"summary\": \"A small legend sprite in the top-left corner defines a pattern that maps to existing colored blocks in the grid; missing pixels from the legend are then placed at corresponding scaled positions.\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_64efde09_20260506_220547/report.json:490:    \"description\": \"精灵两两活跃边面对面放置射线必然交叉，交叉点用混合规则着色。解题者需理解对称布局产生的碰撞模式并推断混合规则。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/annotations/668eec9a.json:3:  \"src\": \"same-color foreground line segments on the background\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/final_audit_3e6067c3.md:42:| 3e6067c3 | D13 | 1 | 交叉点使用混合色 | 50/50 | ✓ |\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/final_audit_3e6067c3.json:435:    \"variant_name\": \"交叉点使用混合色\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/annotations/88bcf3b4.json:2:  \"summary\": \"An irregular line segment connected to the terminal of a vertical/horizontal bar perpendicular to grid edge wraps around a nearby obstacle sprite and repositions while preserving total pixel count.\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/annotations/88bcf3b4.json:4:  \"src\": \"irregular line segment attached to terminal of edge-perpendicular bar s\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a6f40cea_20260503_merged/report.json:567:    \"description\": \"多条路径从各自触点出发延伸，碰到另一条已有路径时停止。碰撞/交叉点像素变为第三种颜色。解题者需推断碰撞停止规则和碰撞点特殊着色规则。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a6f40cea_20260503_merged/report.json:1466:    \"description\": \"4-6个组件的路径密集交错，交叉点像素变为第三种颜色。大量组件使交叉频繁发生，输出呈现复杂多色交叉图案。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_7b80bb43_20260502_052324/report.json:285:    \"description\": \"输入中间隙两侧各有一个L形对角提示（形成镜像对称），L的朝向指示间隙所在的线段方向（水平/垂直），L的臂长指示间隙到交叉点的距离。输出为填充间隙、删除L形提示后的干净网络。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_581f7754_20260506_113449/report.json:573:    \"description\": \"锚点为网格内部穿过整行/列的彩色十字线，精灵沿十字线滑动使标记对齐到交叉点。输出裁切为十字线附近的窄条带区域。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_7c66cb00_20260502_052355/report.json:639:    \"description\": \"精灵不在顶部，而在网格左右两侧排列。条不是全宽的，而是居中的较短条。精灵从两侧水平移动到条的位置，垂直居中放入条中。左侧精灵从左进入，右侧精灵从右进入，在条的中间区域汇合。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/variant_meta_3e6067c3.json:199:    \"alt_name\": \"交叉点使用混合色\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/review_summary_2d0172a1.md:17:- D15/1: sampled inputs show non-empty 3x3 corner legend regions used as style cues.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/annotations/d59b0160.json:11:  \"multi_step\": \"Step 1: identify legend colors from top-left corner; Step 2: find all connected components; Step 3: delete components that contain ALL legend colors\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/annotations/16de56c4.json:6:  \"dst\": \"fill the line segment between extreme occurrences (or whole line if no companion color)\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a47bf94d_20260503_054255/report.json:1447:    \"description\": \"交叉处仅单侧有标记（左侧=左转，右侧=右转），网格中存在不连通的假管道段，交叉点标记数量编码行为（1个=直行，3个=转弯）。解题者需忽略假管道，从标记位置和数量推断交叉行为。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a6f40cea_20260503_070310/report.json:567:    \"description\": \"多条路径从各自触点出发延伸，碰到另一条已有路径时停止。碰撞/交叉点像素变为第三种颜色。解题者需推断碰撞停止规则和碰撞点特殊着色规则。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a6f40cea_20260503_070310/report.json:1466:    \"description\": \"4-6个组件的路径密集交错，交叉点像素变为第三种颜色。大量组件使交叉频繁发生，输出呈现复杂多色交叉图案。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/edb79dae_review_extract.json:10:    \"main_doc_head\": \"Fill a framed slot layout by matching tiny interior shape markers to external sprites, then recolor by area-count legend cards.\\n\\nInput structure:\\n- One background color, one gray rectangular frame, and sparse 2-3 pixel monochrome markers inside the frame.\\n  Each marker sits at the top-left corner of an otherwise empty sprite slot.\\n- Outside the frame are larger sprite templates and several opaque 5x6 legend cards that all share one repeated code color.\\n\\nRule:\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/edb79dae_review_extract.json:150:    \"main_doc_head\": \"Stamp external sprites into the frame, then recolor them by a mirrored bottom-right spatial legend.\\n\\nInput structure:\\n- The canvas background contains one gray rectangular frame with solid colored placeholders inside.\\n- The bottom-right corner of the whole canvas contains a fixed 5x5 legend panel with four colored 2x2 blocks.\\n- Outside the frame and outside that corner panel: one sprite template per placeholder color.\\n\\nRule:\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/edb79dae_review_extract.json:220:    \"main_doc_head\": \"Fill a framed tray by shape-matching guide markers to external sprites, rotating them by cavity quadrant, and recoloring them through the outside legend.\\n\\nInput structure:\\n- A gray rectangular frame encloses a gray tray whose occupied slots each contain a sparse guide marker in the slot's upper-left corner and a square bg cavity in the slot's lower-right corner.\\n- Outside the frame sit one unrotated source-colored sprite template per shape and one compact two-color legend block per source color.\\n\\nRule:\\n- Detect every cavity and the same-size marker placed exactly one cavity-width above and left of it, then normalize the marker's unrotated shape.\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/edb79dae_review_extract.json:290:    \"main_doc_head\": \"Stamp external sprites into the frame, then recolor them from a two-layer spatial legend.\\n\\nInput structure:\\n- The canvas background contains one gray rectangular frame with solid colored placeholders inside.\\n- The top-left corner contains a fixed legend rectangle made of two aligned 2x2 panels:\\n  a left base-color panel of solid swatches and a right modifier panel of glyphs.\\n- Outside the frame and outside that reserved legend area: one sprite template per placeholder color.\\n\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/edb79dae_review_extract.json:300:    \"main_doc_head\": \"Reconstruct rectangles from diagonal markers, stamp them from anchor pixels inside a frame, then recolor them.\\n\\nInput structure:\\n- The grid has a bg color, one rectangular gray frame, and single-pixel colored anchors inside that frame.\\n- Outside the frame, each anchor color appears as two same-color pixels at opposite corners of a rectangle bbox.\\n- Small overlapping two-color legend glyphs outside the frame map each anchor/source color to its output color.\\n\\nRule:\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/annotations/9385bd28.json:11:  \"multi_step\": \"Step 1: identify legend as vertically stacked color pairs at bottom-left corner; Step 2: process legend entries from bottom to top; Step 3: for each legend entry (marker_color on left, fill_color on right), find all diagonal pairs of marker_color pixels; Step 4: fill rectangle between each diagonal pair with fill_color\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_80a900e0_20260502_074614/report.json:1179:    \"description\": \"射线遇障碍物反弹继续传播（反射），且不同射线交叉处使用第三种颜色标记。反射路径更长更复杂，交叉点更多，标记点形成不规则分布。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/annotations/97d7923e.json:11:  \"multi_step\": \"Step 1: identify legend entries in top-left corner by color and count blocks; Step 2: identify vertical bars by their endpoint colors and group them; Step 3: within each group, rank bars by length; Step 4: match bar with length-rank equal to legend block count; Step 5: recolor matched bar entirely with legend color\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/arc-agi-2-eval-annotations-merge.json:303:    \"dst\": \"fill the line segment between extreme occurrences (or whole line if no companion color)\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/arc-agi-2-eval-annotations-merge.json:628:    \"multi_step\": \"Step 1: identify legend as vertically stacked color pairs at bottom-left corner; Step 2: process legend entries from bottom to top; Step 3: for each legend entry (marker_color on left, fill_color on right), find all diagonal pairs of marker_color pixels; Step 4: fill rectangle between each diagonal pair with fill_color\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/arc-agi-2-eval-annotations-merge.json:648:    \"multi_step\": \"Step 1: identify legend entries in top-left corner by color and count blocks; Step 2: identify vertical bars by their endpoint colors and group them; Step 3: within each group, rank bars by length; Step 4: match bar with length-rank equal to legend block count; Step 5: recolor matched bar entirely with legend color\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/arc-agi-2-eval-annotations-merge.json:747:    \"summary\": \"A small legend sprite in the top-left corner defines a pattern that maps to existing colored blocks in the grid; missing pixels from the legend are then placed at corresponding scaled positions.\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/arc-agi-2-eval-annotations-merge.json:843:    \"multi_step\": \"Step 1: identify legend colors from top-left corner; Step 2: find all connected components; Step 3: delete components that contain ALL legend colors\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/arc-agi-2-eval-annotations-merge.json:1111:    \"summary\": \"An irregular line segment connected to the terminal of a vertical/horizontal bar perpendicular to grid edge wraps around a nearby obstacle sprite and repositions while preserving total pixel count.\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/arc-agi-2-eval-annotations-merge.json:1113:    \"src\": \"irregular line segment attached to terminal of edge-perpendicular bar s\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/a47bf94d_parent_review_manual.md:24:  - 说明：变体改变的是交叉点语义表达方式；原始 solver 对该生成分布同样成立，因此出现全样本同输出。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/e376de54.py:42:    Align parallel colored line segments so they all share the same start and end positions as a reference line.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/e376de54.py:46:    - Several parallel line segments (diagonal, horizontal, or vertical), each a different color, running in the same direction but starting/ending at different